---

<section class="relative z-20 py-15 xl:py-20" aria-labelledby="why-support-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-151 flex-col items-center gap-7.5 text-center">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-none font-bold uppercase">Your gift makes it possible</p>
        <h2 id="why-support-heading" class="text-3xl font-bold md:text-5xl">Why Crew419 Needs Your Support</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-119 leading-none">
        Your generosity allows Crew419 to organize safe, well-planned mission trips, equip participants through discipleship, and partner with local churches serving their communities every day.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
